t, low-latency audio translation pipeline using a producer-consumer threaded design across Whisper (ASR), MarianMT (Neural Translation), and Meta MMS (TTS). Achieved <3ms Voice Activity Detection…","Developed a distributed medical computer vision pipeline on Google Cloud Platform (GCP) leveraging PySpark and Spark ML for large-scale fundus image preprocessing. Applied PyTorch deep neural networks with custom CLAHE…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/adimalkar/AdiMalkar/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"13cd7dfa5494b6232f8889c53102bf6fbc532df731bdc5f346119676797f8396","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:59.270Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:59.270Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Building autonomous AI systems & high-performance data pipelines.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/adimalkar/AdiMalkar/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"13cd7dfa5494b6232f8889c53102bf6fbc532df731bdc5f346119676797f8396","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/adimalkar/AdiMalkar/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:59.271Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T21:28:38Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/adimalkar/AdiMalkar/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:59.271Z","hash":"13cd7dfa5494b6232f8889c53102bf6fbc532df731bdc5f346119676797f8396","originalBytes":22226,"storedBytes":22226,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["nbsp","data","intelligence","systems","across","analysis","fixed","fraud","llm","multi-agent","platform","rag","translation","about","contract","distributed","evaluation","github","instead","models","pipeline","agent","alignment","autonomous","bm25","building","built","celery","context","currently","demo","dense","detection","detector","deterministic","edge","engine","engineer","field","fixes","forensic","frameworks","genuinely","hackathon","hallucination","hybrid","images","infrastructure","insurance","jury","just","langgraph","latency","live","low-latenc